{"code":0,"data":{"job_post_detail":{"id":"7657133162485680426","title":"力学工程师（AG）-2027校招","description":"1、对无人机整机及关键部件进行静力学分析，评估其在各种载荷条件下的强度、刚度和稳定性，提出相应的结构加强方案；\n2、对无人机进行模态分析和测试，获取其固有频率和振型，提出结构参数优化建议，避免共振现象的发生；\n3、进行振动响应分析，评估无人机在外部激励下的动态响应特性，提升IMU及摄像头的减振效果；\n4、对无人机关键部件进行疲劳分析，预测其使用寿命，提出改进设计方案，提高无人机的可靠性和耐久性；\n5、根据无人机结构特点和设计要求，制定力学试验加速方案，协助结构工程师解决测试中的结构老化问题。","requirement":"1、力学、机械、航天、船舶等领域硕博学历，项目经验极其丰富，可以放宽要求；\n2、精通主流 CAE 分析工具和拓扑优化工具，对振动、冲击、疲劳问题有独到见解；\n3、精通主流测试分析工具，对产品失效和可靠性问题有敏锐的技术洞察力，能快速定位复杂系统力学问题根源，并提出有效解决方案。","recruit_type":{"id":"201","name":"正式","en_name":"Regular","i18n_name":"正式","depth":2,"parent":{"id":"2","name":"校招","en_name":"Campus","i18n_name":"校招","depth":1,"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"publish_time":1782815509256,"channel_online_status":1,"job_id":"7657133162485532970","city_list":[{"code":"CT_128","name":"深圳","en_name":"Shenzhen","location_type":3,"i18n_name":"深圳","py_name":"shenzhen","mdm_code":"MDCY00000249","node_status":1}],"job_post_info":{"recruitment_type":{"id":"201","name":"正式","en_name":"Regular","i18n_name":"正式","depth":2,"parent":{"id":"2","name":"校招","en_name":"Campus","i18n_name":"校招","depth":1,"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"HighlightList":[],"JobChannelPublishList":[],"job_post_object_value_map":{},"address_list":[],"city_list":[],"correlation_job_list":[],"tag_list":[],"storefront_list":[],"target_major_list":[],"job_post_process_time_list":[],"job_level_id_list":[]},"city_info_list_for_delivery":[{"code":"CT_128","name":"深圳","en_name":"Shenzhen","location_type":3,"i18n_name":"深圳","py_name":"shenzhen","mdm_code":"MDCY00000249","node_status":1}],"tag_list":[],"storefront_mode":1,"storefront_list":[],"process_type":2},"recommend_job_post_List":[]},"message":"ok","error":null}